3. Independent verification sources (no code derived)
================================================================================

The local protocol's field vocabulary was verified against, but not copied from:

  - nikolairahimi/mitsubishi-comfort (no declared license; used only to confirm
    field names already observed on real hardware)
  - The Mitsubishi Comfort v3 API as observed directly from the author's own
    devices.

Vane and fan-speed value domains were established empirically against
MLZ-KX06NL-U1, MLZ-KX12NL-U1 and MSZ-GX06NL-U1 hardware.
